# signal-dashboard keys. Copy this file to ".env" (setup.bat does it for you) and paste each key after the "=".
# Never share .env, never paste keys into chat, never upload it. .gitignore already keeps it off GitHub.
#
# Alpaca paper-account keys (the same ones your agent uses are fine).
APCA_API_KEY_ID=
APCA_API_SECRET_KEY=

# Free keys (sign up on each site):
TWELVEDATA_API_KEY=
COINGECKO_API_KEY=
FRED_API_KEY=
FINNHUB_API_KEY=

# Phase 7, GitHub (for the phone version):
#   GITHUB_TOKEN: a fine-grained token with access to ONLY your signal-dashboard repo, permission "Contents: Read and write"
#   GITHUB_REPO: yourname/signal-dashboard
#   DASHBOARD_PASSPHRASE: you type this on your phone to unlock the data. 4+ random words is good. Not your GitHub password.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
GITHUB_REPO=
DASHBOARD_PASSPHRASE=
